This is an independent Rust implementation, not a port of existing code: the
inference engine was written from scratch against ONNX Runtime. The per-file
copyright headers state the same.


MODEL OWNERSHIP

The models this project converts and runs are not ours, and converting a model
does not change its licence or its ownership.

  - GLiNER2 and GLiNER2.5 are developed by Fastino (https://fastino.ai).
    See arXiv:2507.18546. The weights this engine loads originate from
    https://huggingface.co/fastino and remain subject to the licence their
    publisher sets. Check it before redistributing them with an application.

  - GLiNER (Generalist Model for Named Entity Recognition), the line these
    models descend from, is the work of Urchade Zaratiana et al.
    See arXiv:2311.08526.

  - No model weights are distributed from this repository. The ONNX exports
    published at https://huggingface.co/jugaadsrl/gliner2.5-multi-v1-onnx are
    derived artefacts of Fastino's checkpoint and carry its licence; the
    conversion adds no ownership claim over the model.

This project implements inference for those models and claims no ownership
over them. What is ours is the engine, the exporter and the tests.


